    "A read-only snapshot of %@ is shared with this chat when you send. Manage it in Computer Use settings." : {
      "comment" : "A help text explaining that the \"Screen context\" chip is a read-only snapshot of the app that was focused just before Osaurus, and that it can be managed in Computer Use settings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "A read-only snapshot of %@ is shared with this chat when you send. Manage it in Computer Use settings."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "전송할 때 %@의 읽기 전용 스냅샷이 이 채팅과 공유됩니다. 컴퓨터 제어 설정에서 이를 관리할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "При отправке в этот чат передается доступный только для чтения снимок %@. Управляйте этим в настройках использования компьютера."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发送时，%@ 的只读快照将与此聊天共享。可在电脑操作设置中管理。"
