    "Experimental: boot from each agent's own copy-on-write clone of the base image so system packages persist per agent" : {
      "comment" : "Description of a feature that allows containers to be booted from their own copy-on-write clones of the base image, persisting system packages per agent.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Experimental: boot from each agent's own copy-on-write clone of the base image so system packages persist per agent"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Experimental: boot from each agent's own copy-on-write clone of the base image so system packages persist per agent"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Experimental: boot from each agent's own copy-on-write clone of the base image so system packages persist per agent"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实验性功能：从每个代理自己的基础镜像写时复制克隆启动，使系统包在每个代理之间独立保留"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "實驗性功能：從每個代理自己的基礎映像寫時複製複製啟動，使系統套件在每個代理之間獨立保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Experimental: when the server eviction policy is Flexible (Multi Model) and memory projections say both fit, load the helper model alongside the chat model instead of unloading and reloading it — skipping the swap round-trip on high-RAM Macs. Tight RAM or the Strict policy always falls back to the normal handoff." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Experimental: when the server eviction policy is Flexible (Multi Model) and memory projections say both fit, load the helper model alongside the chat model instead of unloading and reloading it — skipping the swap round-trip on high-RAM Macs. Tight RAM or the Strict policy always falls back to the normal handoff."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Experimental: when the server eviction policy is Flexible (Multi Model) and memory projections say both fit, load the helper model alongside the chat model instead of unloading and reloading it — skipping the swap round-trip on high-RAM Macs. Tight RAM or the Strict policy always falls back to the normal handoff."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Experimental: when the server eviction policy is Flexible (Multi Model) and memory projections say both fit, load the helper model alongside the chat model instead of unloading and reloading it — skipping the swap round-trip on high-RAM Macs. Tight RAM or the Strict policy always falls back to the normal handoff."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实验性功能：当服务器驱逐策略设为「灵活（多模型）」且内存预测显示两个模型都能容纳时，将辅助模型与聊天模型并行加载，而非先卸载再重新加载——在大内存 Mac 上跳过换入换出的往返开销。内存紧张或采用严格策略时，始终回退至常规交接流程。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "實驗性功能：當伺服器驅逐策略設為「靈活（多模型）」，且內存預測顯示兩個模型都能容納時，會同時載入輔助模型與對話模型，而不是先卸載再重新載入——這樣可以跳過在大內存 Mac 上的載入與卸載的往返開銷。當內存不足或使用嚴格策略時，會自動回退至常規的載入與卸載流程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
