    "Let spawned workers read files themselves (file_read / file_search) so bulk reading stays out of this agent's context." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip text for the \"Worker tools\" row in the agent detail view, explaining that allowing spawned workers to read files themselves allows bulk reading to happen outside of this agent's context.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erzeugte Worker lesen Dateien selbst (file_read / file_search), damit umfangreiches Lesen nicht im Kontext dieses Agenten landet."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "생성된 워커가 직접 파일을 읽도록 허용합니다(file_read / file_search). 대량 읽기가 이 에이전트의 컨텍스트를 차지하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Позволяет порождённым воркерам самим читать файлы (file_read / file_search), чтобы массовое чтение не попадало в контекст этого агента."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让派生的工作代理自行读取文件（file_read / file_search），避免批量读取占用此代理的上下文。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讓派生的工作代理自行讀取文件（file_read / file_search），避免批量讀取佔用此代理的上下文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent act between your messages." : {
