    },
    "Let the agent automate this Mac by writing and running AppleScript with an on-device model. Each script is shown for your approval or auto-run with a warning, per the mode below." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Let the agent automate this Mac by writing and running AppleScript with an on-device model. Each script is shown for your approval or auto-run with a warning, per the mode below."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Let the agent automate this Mac by writing and running AppleScript with an on-device model. Each script is shown for your approval or auto-run with a warning, per the mode below."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Позвольте агенту автоматизировать этот Mac: писать и запускать AppleScript с помощью локальной модели. Каждый сценарий показывается для подтверждения или запускается автоматически с предупреждением — в зависимости от режима ниже."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让智能体通过使用设备端模型编写和运行 AppleScript 来自动化此 Mac。每个脚本都会显示以供你批准，或根据下方模式带警告自动运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "讓智能體通過使用設備端模型編寫和運行 AppleScript 來自動化此 Mac。每個腳本都會顯示以供你批准，或根據下方模式帶警告自動運行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the agent control macOS apps for you — clicking, typing, and reading the screen. Reads and navigation run automatically; edits and anything consequential pause for your approval." : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle for the \"Computer Use\" per-agent capability card in the Agent Detail View.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Lassen Sie den Agenten macOS-Apps für Sie steuern — klicken, tippen und den Bildschirm lesen. Lese- und Navigationsvorgänge laufen automatisch; Änderungen und alles Wichtige warten auf Ihre Genehmigung."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
