    },
    "The 256-bit encryption key lives in your macOS Keychain. It never leaves this Mac and is not synced to iCloud." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The 256-bit encryption key lives in your macOS Keychain. It never leaves this Mac and is not synced to iCloud."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "256비트 암호화 키는 macOS 키체인에 저장됩니다. 이 Mac을 벗어나지 않으며 iCloud에 동기화되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "256-битный ключ шифрования находится в вашей Связке ключей macOS. Он никогда не покидает этот Mac и не синхронизируется с iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "256位加密密钥存储在您的macOS钥匙串中。它永远不会离开这台Mac，并且不会同步到iCloud。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "256位加密密鑰存儲在您的macOS鑰匙串中。它永遠不會離開這臺Mac，並且不會同步到iCloud。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the agent" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "dem Agenten"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에이전트"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "агент"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能體"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent adds rows with `db_insert` / `db_upsert` when it has something to remember. You can also ask it directly in chat." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Agent fügt mit `db_insert` / `db_upsert` Zeilen hinzu, wenn er sich etwas merken möchte. Du kannst ihn auch direkt im Chat fragen."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에이전트는 기억할 내용이 있을 때 `db_insert` / `db_upsert`를 사용하여 행을 추가합니다. 채팅에서 직접 요청할 수도 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Агент добавляет строки с `db_insert`/`db_upsert`, когда ему есть что запомнить. Вы также можете задать это прямо в чате."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当智能体有需要记住的内容时，会使用 `db_insert` / `db_upsert` 添加行。你也可以在聊天中直接请求它。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當智能體有需要記住的內容時，會使用 `db_insert` / `db_upsert` 添加行。你也可以在聊天中直接請求它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent can read and write files within this folder, including over authenticated remote agent runs. Writes stay inside the folder; shell and git remain disabled." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the host folder access feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The agent can read and write files within this folder, including over authenticated remote agent runs. Writes stay inside the folder; shell and git remain disabled."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에이전트는 인증된 원격 에이전트 실행을 포함하여 이 폴더 내의 파일을 읽고 쓸 수 있습니다. 쓰기 작업은 폴더 내부에 유지되며 쉘 및 git은 계속 비활성화됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Агент может читать и записывать файлы в этой папке, в том числе при удалённых запусках агента с проверкой подлинности. Пишет оставаться внутри папки; оболочка и git остаются отключенными."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该代理可在此文件夹内读写文件，包括通过经过身份验证的远程代理运行时亦可执行。写入操作限定在该文件夹内；Shell 与 Git 保持禁用状态。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該代理可在此文件夾內讀寫文件，包括通過經過身份驗證的遠程代理運行時亦可執行。寫入操作限定在該文件夾內；Shell 與 Git 保持禁用狀態。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent determines the AI's behavior and available tools." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Agent bestimmt das Verhalten der KI und die verfügbaren Tools."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에이전트는 AI의 동작과 사용 가능한 도구를 결정합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Агент определяет поведение ИИ и доступные инструменты."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体决定 AI 的行为和可用工具。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能體決定 AI 的行爲和可用工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent only runs when you ask. Scheduled API calls from the agent are rejected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The agent only runs when you ask. Scheduled API calls from the agent are rejected."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The agent only runs when you ask. Scheduled API calls from the agent are rejected."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "The agent only runs when you ask. Scheduled API calls from the agent are rejected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体仅在您请求时运行。代理的定时API调用被拒绝。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "代理程式僅在您要求時執行。代理程式排程的API呼叫將被拒絕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent will schedule itself when it has work to do." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Agent plant sich selbst, wenn er etwas zu tun hat."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "에이전트는 수행할 작업이 있을 때 자체적으로 일정을 예약합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Агент будет планировать свое выполнение, когда у него есть работа."
