          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The token is stored in Keychain and is never written to the Telegram configuration file." : {
      "comment" : "A description below the Telegram bot token field, explaining that the token is stored in the user's keychain and not in the app's configuration file.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
