          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your databases are encrypted with a 256-bit key in your macOS Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ihre Datenbanken werden mit einem 256-Bit-Schlüssel in Ihrem macOS-Schlüsselbund verschlüsselt."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "데이터베이스는 macOS 키체인의 256비트 키로 암호화됩니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ваши базы данных зашифрованы 256-битным ключом в вашей Связке ключей macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的数据库在 macOS 钥匙串中使用 256 位密钥进行加密。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的數據庫在 macOS 鑰匙串中使用 256 位密鑰進行加密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your databases are not encrypted by Osaurus. macOS FileVault protects them at rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ihre Datenbanken werden von Osaurus nicht verschlüsselt. macOS FileVault schützt sie im Ruhezustand."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "데이터베이스는 Osaurus에 의해 암호화되지 않습니다. macOS FileVault가 유휴 상태에서 데이터를 보호합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ваши базы данных не зашифрованы Osaurus. macOS FileVault защищает их при хранении."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的数据库未被Osaurus加密。macOS FileVault在静止状态下保护它们。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "您的數據庫未被Osaurus加密。macOS FileVault在靜止狀態下保護它們。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your free $2.50 credit lets you start immediately. Osaurus switches to your private model automatically when it's ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mit deinem kostenlosen Guthaben von 2,50 $ kannst du sofort starten. Osaurus wechselt automatisch zu deinem privaten Modell, sobald es bereit ist."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "무료 $2.50 크레딧으로 바로 시작할 수 있습니다. 비공개 모델이 준비되면 Osaurus가 자동으로 전환합니다."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Бесплатный кредит $2,50 позволит начать сразу. Когда приватная модель будет готова, Osaurus автоматически переключится на неё."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费 $2.50 额度让你立即开始。私有模型准备好后，Osaurus 会自动切换。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免費 $2.50 額度讓你立即開始。私人模型準備好後，Osaurus 會自動切換。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your identity is active" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deine Identität ist aktiv"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사용자의 신원이 활성화되었습니다"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
